    "summary": "=============================================================================================================================\nLayer (type:depth-idx)                             Input Shape               Output Shape              Param #\n=============================================================================================================================\nHead                                               [2, 384]                  [2, 47]                   --\n\u251c\u2500GaussianNoise: 1-1                               [2, 384]                  [2, 384]                  --\n\u251c\u2500Serial: 1-2                                      [2, 384]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2514\u2500ModuleList: 2-1                             --                        --                        --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dense: 3-1                             [2, 384]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Sequential: 4-1                   [2, 384]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Linear: 5-1                  [2, 384]                  [2, 994]                  382,690\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Norm: 5-2                    [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500BatchNorm1d: 6-1        [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  1,988\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Activation: 5-3              [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500GELU: 6-2               [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dropout: 5-4                 [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dense: 3-2                             [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Sequential: 4-2                   [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Linear: 5-5                  [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  989,030\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Norm: 5-6                    [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500BatchNorm1d: 6-3        [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  1,988\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Activation: 5-7              [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500GELU: 6-4               [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dropout: 5-8                 [2, 994]                  [2, 994]                  --\n\u251c\u2500Linear: 1-3                                      [2, 994]                  [2, 47]                   46,765\n=============================================================================================================================\nTotal params: 1,422,461\nTrainable params: 1,422,461\nNon-trainable params: 0\nTotal mult-adds (Units.MEGABYTES): 2.84\n=============================================================================================================================\nInput size (MB): 0.00\nForward/backward pass size (MB): 0.06\nParams size (MB): 5.69\nEstimated Total Size (MB): 5.76\n============================================================================================================================="
